                    <h2>Detection Signatures: How We Find Them</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-explainer">
                    <h4>Why This Matters</h4>
                    <p>Favicon hashes provide reliable fingerprints for identifying OpenClaw instances across the internet. Different favicon variants indicate specific versions or forks. This methodology enables comprehensive internet-wide scanning without false positives.</p>
