                <div class="strike-hero-text">
                    <h1>TAXII 2.1 Threat Intelligence Feeds</h1>
                    <p>Machine-readable STIX 2.1 intelligence via the TAXII 2.1 protocol &mdash; subscribe programmatically to DECLAWED threat data</p>
                </div>
                <div class="strike-contact-badges">
                    <span class="strike-badge-label">Request access:</span>
                    <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d8abacaab1b3bd98abbdbbadaab1aca1abbbb7aabdbbb9aabcf6b1b7" class="strike-badge"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7c0f080e1517193c0f191f090e1508050f1f130e191f1d0e18521513">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>
                    <a href="https://strike.securityscorecard.com" target="_blank" class="strike-badge">strike.securityscorecard.com</a>
                    <a href="https://twitter.com/STRIKE_intel" target="_blank" class="strike-badge">@STRIKE_intel</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- OVERVIEW -->
            <section class="research-section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-icon strike-icon"><img src="/assets/strike_icon.png" alt="STRIKE" /></div>
                    <h2>Overview</h2>
                    <span class="section-badge live">LIVE</span>
                </div>
                <div class="section-explainer">
                    <h4>What is TAXII?</h4>
                    <p>TAXII (Trusted Automated eXchange of Intelligence Information) is a standard protocol for exchanging cyber threat intelligence. DECLAWED implements TAXII 2.1 to serve STIX 2.1 objects representing exposed AI agent infrastructure, vulnerabilities, channel intelligence, and social media indicators. All data is generated on-the-fly from our live database and served as read-only collections.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="taxii-tw">
                    <table class="taxii-t">
                        <thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td>Protocol</td><td>TAXII 2.1</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Data Format</td><td>STIX 2.1</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Authentication</td><td>HTTP Basic Auth</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Collections</td><td>9 Live Feeds</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Access Mode</td><td>Read-Only</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Content-Type</td><td><code>application/taxii+json;version=2.1</code></td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- COLLECTIONS -->
