                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td><span class="stix-tag">vulnerability</span></td><td>SDO</td><td>Name = CVE ID. External references to NVD and GHSA. Custom extensions: <code>x_cvss_score</code>, <code>x_exploit_available</code>, <code>x_patched_version</code>, <code>x_epss_score</code></td></tr>
                        </tbody>
