                                    <tr><td>health_check</td><td>*/1 * * * *</td><td>30s ago</td><td>30s</td><td><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>log_rotate</td><td>0 0 * * *</td><td>22h ago</td><td>2h</td><td><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>session_cleanup</td><td>0 */6 * * *</td><td>4h ago</td><td>2h</td><td><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></td></tr>
                                </tbody></table>
                            </div>
                            <!-- SKILLS -->
                            <div id="sim-screen-skills" class="sim-screen">
                                <h3 class="sim-screen-title">Skills</h3>
                                <p class="sim-muted">Agent capabilities and tool permissions. Skills define what the agent can do on the host system.</p>
                                <div class="sim-skills-grid">
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>file_read</span><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></div><p>Read files from the host filesystem. No path restrictions.</p></div>
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>file_write</span><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></div><p>Write and create files on the host filesystem.</p></div>
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>shell_exec</span><span class="sim-badge-red">DANGER</span></div><p>Execute arbitrary shell commands as the container user (root).</p></div>
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>network_request</span><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></div><p>Make HTTP/TCP requests to any host. No egress filtering.</p></div>
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>browser</span><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></div><p>Launch headless browser for web interaction and scraping.</p></div>
                                    <div class="sim-skill-card"><div class="sim-skill-header"><span>code_interpreter</span><span class="sim-badge-green">Enabled</span></div><p>Execute Python/Node.js code in the runtime environment.</p></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
