                                    <div class="sim-log-line"><span class="sim-log-ts">10:33:18</span> <span class="sim-log-info">[INFO]</span> Telegram channel connected (session: tg_bot_01)</div>
                                    <div class="sim-log-line"><span class="sim-log-ts">10:33:18</span> <span class="sim-log-info">[INFO]</span> Signal channel connected (session: signal_primary)</div>
                                    <div class="sim-log-line"><span class="sim-log-ts">10:33:19</span> <span class="sim-log-warn">[WARN]</span> Docker socket mounted at /var/run/docker.sock — container escape possible</div>
